# Rounding
- "shall provide roundTiesToEven and the three directed rounding attributes"
- "The roundTiesToEven rounding-direction attribute shall be the default rounding-direction attribute for
results in binary formats.""

- roundTiesToEven (default)
- roundTowardPositive
